cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code in academic research, please cite the associated publication below."
title: "Endoscopic Radiomics for Bladder Cancer Grading"
abstract: >-
  Interpretable multichannel radiomics analysis of white-light cystoscopy images for bladder cancer
  grade prediction: channel-wise preprocessing, PyRadiomics feature extraction from grey, red, green
  and blue channels, Coe-Thr-Lasso feature selection, five machine-learning classifiers,
  patient-level evaluation (bootstrap CIs, calibration, decision curves) and SHAP explanations.
type: software
authors:
